Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?perf(hud):=20radar=20asteroid=20still-layer=20+?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20drawTrail=20stroke=20batch=20(~5.8=C3=97)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quiet radar.draw still walked the full asteroidSource census every 10 Hz tick
even when the pilot had not moved a radar pixel. Dormant field rocks do not
translate, so a quantized-player still-layer reuses the last field-cell +
near-dot census until pose/range/target/field/index changes or a 0.5 s rescan.
drawTrail collapses per-segment stroke into one path at mid alpha.

Offline floor (parked, 5×11 isolated): median ~5.8×, floor ≥3.95×.
---
